    kind: work_item  # e0b5
    title: "auto-pr vPR machinery: non-ff push misclassified as remote-unavailable; prune is sha-only (misses patch-equivalent merged vPRs); queue ref breaks on branch deletion"  # e0b5
    status: needs_human_review  # e0b5
